{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09902","headline":"饯王岑判官赴襄阳道 · 岑参","name":"饯王岑判官赴襄阳道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人汉阳使，走马向南荆。\n不厌楚山路，祗怜襄水清。\n津头习氏宅，江上夫人城。\n夜入橘花宿，朝穿桐叶行。\n害羣应自慑，持法固须平。\n暂得青门醉，斜光速去程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}